<MainLayout title="Coro Awareness Training | Blue Cap IT — Mid-Atlantic &amp; Carolinas" description="Coro Security Awareness Training — interactive modules and phishing simulations to reduce human risk. Blue Cap IT serves MD, DC, DE, NJ, PA, VA, NC, SC." schema={faqSchema}>
